  dialogues:
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Seems lonely in a way, to live boxed in like this, all alone.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Nah, Seems peacefull.
    - "What could be better than having your own place, not worrying about annoying
      people up in your space, going on and on about \u2019what a great day its gonna
      be'."
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dbac39fc5bdca074d874e5fd42ef71b0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "That felt directed at me\u2026"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Like I said, seems lonely.
